# Build output and staging
# - build/ : PyInstaller staging, recreated on every build_tkvc.ps1 run
# - dist/  : the built tkvc.exe and the il_features copy it loads at runtime
# - _direct_smoke_out/ : ad-hoc smoke-test dumps
build/
dist/
_direct_smoke_out/

# Compiled artifacts.
#
# *.il used to be tracked, on the stated grounds that the Testkit
# "*_regress.il" files are golden baselines and tools/ holds checked-in IL
# samples. Both claims were wrong: no .tkv, .ps1 or .py in the tree reads any
# .il file - the references to probe_hashset.il, probe_raise.il and
# probe_closure.il in the sources are comments about hand-written scratch
# probes that were deleted long ago, not files the build consults - and there
# are no .il files in tools/ at all. The 151 tracked ones were all dumps
# emitted by `tkvc build --emit-il`, and one test run rewrote them.
*.exe
*.il
*.pdb
*.dll
*.pyd

# Python bytecode / caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Editor / OS
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
*~
*.tmp

  # Testkit ghi output pickle vao CWD khi chay (logging_pickle_py_tree_test.tkv
  # goi pickle_dump_* voi duong dan tuong doi) - artifact, khong phai nguon.
pkl_*_test.bin

  # Cung dang: bo test cua Data/Data-ecosystem (chay qua datagate.ps1) ghi
  # CSV/feather vao CWD khi chay trong repo nay. Ten bat dau bang '_' hoac
  # la 'test_out.csv' - deu la output, khong phai nguon. KHONG co .tkv nao
  # trong repo tham chieu ten nay (da grep), nen khong vo tinh loai nguon.
_pd_*.csv
_rt6*.csv
_t8stream.csv
_t9par.csv
test_out.csv
ooc_test_tmp.feather

